                                                "text": "A farmer could place an order for a new tractor part by text message and pay for it by mobile money-transfer. A supplier many miles away would then take the part to the local matternet station for airborne dispatch via drone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fadcb6d5-e6fd-311f-9336-25cc1784b877",
                                        "entry_id": "5a87f00f-3481-3b95-a851-e5987d597421",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by an extreme degree of fluidity; moving or flowing with great freedom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edeef7db-523a-49b4-a5c1-0837c5912152",
                                                "sense_id": "fadcb6d5-e6fd-311f-9336-25cc1784b877",
                                                "text": "Mercury is a mobile liquid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c64b5b5-5883-3338-912a-86f723633d57",
                                        "entry_id": "5a87f00f-3481-3b95-a851-e5987d597421",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Easily moved in feeling, purpose, or direction; excitable; changeable; fickle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cad7a7c-c54a-4862-a552-c70844d2149f",
                                                "sense_id": "4c64b5b5-5883-3338-912a-86f723633d57",
                                                "text": "the quick and mobile curiosity of her disposition"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1066c0eb-132c-38f7-a483-7f17bf03607a",
                                        "entry_id": "5a87f00f-3481-3b95-a851-e5987d597421",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Changing in appearance and expression under the influence of the mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f56df3bb-0208-419f-bec2-3b84e1f4f9cb",
                                                "sense_id": "1066c0eb-132c-38f7-a483-7f17bf03607a",
                                                "text": "mobile features"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25984340-c9e9-48a4-9da2-12550da411b5",
                                                "sense_id": "1066c0eb-132c-38f7-a483-7f17bf03607a",
                                                "text": "His finely cut features were capable of every variety of expression; they were, to use a French epithet, expressive as their epithets for all social qualities usually are, mobile in the extreme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c2c0c93-70ec-3c10-bb03-a4759110bdc7",
                                        "entry_id": "5a87f00f-3481-3b95-a851-e5987d597421",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being moved, aroused, or excited; capable of spontaneous movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mobile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ac43a6d-e48f-3297-ab33-088ca32375f7",
                                        "entry_id": "efbe1a09-44b9-3f47-a308-cbc1b3627642",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kinetic sculpture or decorative arrangement made of items hanging so that they can move independently from each other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25d25084-34b3-3666-87fb-2210c0385baa",
                                        "entry_id": "efbe1a09-44b9-3f47-a308-cbc1b3627642",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of mobile phone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e8ece6-c470-4612-bbf6-abff0188fd8c",
                                                "sense_id": "25d25084-34b3-3666-87fb-2210c0385baa",
                                                "text": "Mobiles squerking, mobiles chirping / Take the money and run"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85e48f8a-ee35-4582-94dd-2502f2c36050",
                                                "sense_id": "25d25084-34b3-3666-87fb-2210c0385baa",
                                                "text": "Pinned against my neighbours, I could feel small hands, fleeting as lizards, fluttering lightly through my pockets in search of money, mobile, wallet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "385699b0-25ce-3cad-a585-9ea8efa6cb9f",
                                        "entry_id": "efbe1a09-44b9-3f47-a308-cbc1b3627642",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The internet accessed via mobile devices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41e51357-5876-4789-ac9b-a29c66cc862f",
                                                "sense_id": "385699b0-25ce-3cad-a585-9ea8efa6cb9f",
                                                "text": "there are many business opportunities in mobile"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61c204ed-7499-319c-9d57-91cb35ba9e06",
                                        "entry_id": "efbe1a09-44b9-3f47-a308-cbc1b3627642",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who moves or can move (e.g. to travel)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16b2d3b5-9c93-42f2-a1fd-a9f076d72c24",
                                                "sense_id": "61c204ed-7499-319c-9d57-91cb35ba9e06",
                                                "text": "[…] if the constrained \"immobiles\" are given the same transportation access as the unconstrained \"mobiles\". […] We concentrated on a mobile teenager population that had good public transportation or automobile access and a[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d20c3d92-575c-4eea-a2a6-863346ef56e1",
                                                "sense_id": "61c204ed-7499-319c-9d57-91cb35ba9e06",
                                                "text": "Table 6.5 does indeed show that non-changers were more contented […] For Table 6.7 shows that even when we take account of the initial differences between the mobiles and immobiles, the mobiles' ratings of job characteristics move strongly in a positive direction while all the immobiles' record negative shifts. So the pattern is clear and consistent: jobs get better for movers and worse for non-movers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41d9daf2-b9e9-4bdf-ac07-9fcb305d16b5",
                                                "sense_id": "61c204ed-7499-319c-9d57-91cb35ba9e06",
                                                "text": "One ex-airwoman recalls meal times for both 'mobiles' and 'immobiles', when they sat on backless benches at long bare tables. The 'immobiles' brought in their own food, crockery and cutlery. A free-standing iron range was used[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecf6c25d-c08f-394a-9f43-58214685876e",
                                        "entry_id": "efbe1a09-44b9-3f47-a308-cbc1b3627642",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of mob (“non-player character”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
